            },
            {
              "text": "運営資金を寄付に仰いでいるNPO団体にとって、広報活動は生命線ともいえる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼は研究費の援助を民間企業に仰ぎ、ついに画期的な新素材を開発した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "gloss": "to gulp down",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
